    "finalName": "",
    "description": "If you draw a concealed weapon and, before the end of the same round, make an attack against a target that failed to notice the item, the target is considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> against you. You can draw a concealed item or a stowed item as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>. Additionally, if you have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Quick_Draw\" title=\"Quick Draw\">Quick Draw</a> feat, you can reduce this to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>.",
